Viewer log: what the car's media card can show (2026-10-12).

On the Phicomm N1 (wired) the iPhone reports the elapsed time about every 0.45 s and the box forwards
correct durations and positions, yet the car's media card showed wrong times. To see whether that card can
take a Media Session position at all or reads the music element's own timeline instead, the page's
10-second stats now carry the Chrome major version, whether it is an Android WebView, setPositionState
support, the song position/duration it gives the card, and the music element's currentTime/duration.

